<title>POLAND: WEDEL SWINGS TO PLN 6.0 MLN PROFIT IN JAN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL SWINGS TO PLN 6.0 MLN PROFIT IN JAN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.00 vs   1.69 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.85 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.22 vs   0.07 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   63.63 vs  48.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionary is E. Wedel</p>
<p>Zaklady Przemyslu Cukierniczego SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
